    "needsReview": false,
    "note": "Status is stored as palearctic-migrant. The research treated this as a Palearctic summer visitor, which is the same movement, and palearctic-migrant is the status this site already uses. No seasonal change in Africa; strong sex and age differences. Gaps: Newman page 404 — relied on Wikipedia/SABAP1/BE. No Kruger photos; images from elsewhere. Afrikaans name Witborsvleivalk (project list); SABAP1 used Witborspaddavreter. GBIF Kruger peak Nov–Feb. Classic confusion with Montagu's Harrier. monthsPresent set from Newman/SABAP seasonality cross-checked with GBIF Kruger month facets (not abundance)."
  }
